# CodeGraph — Third-Party Notice (placeholder)

CodeGraph is a placeholder baseline for the code-symbol / call-graph / impact-query
capability (ADR-0001). The actual selection is deferred to Phase 3 (YS-97); this file
exists so the gate machinery is in place. Until ADR-0001 is filled and `lock.json`
holds a real digest, the `third-party-check` gate will report CodeGraph as `TBD`
(selection pending) — it does not fail the gate while the component is unreferenced
at runtime, but it WILL fail once a CodeGraph dependency appears in `go.mod` /
`package-lock.json` without a matching, non-TBD lock entry.

